            "source_entity_type": "Institute",
            "relation": "PARTICIPATED_IN",
            "target_entity_instance": "CMIP6",
            "target_entity_type": "Project",
            "paragraph": "For CMIP6 the iterative process involved the CMIP Panel, the CMIP6-endorsed MIPs, the CMIP team at the Program for Climate Model Diagnosis and Intercomparison (PCMDI), the ES-DOC team, and the development of the data request (Juckes et al., 2020).",
